{"id":"432139","name":"酸菜鱼头锅","author":"四月去看海","authorId":"11039065","desc":"","cover":"images/432139/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鱼头","amount":"1个"},{"name":"酸青菜","amount":"100克"},{"name":"木耳","amount":"100克"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"50克"}],"sub":[{"name":"鸡精","amount":"3g"},{"name":"老姜","amount":"5g"},{"name":"猪油","amount":"50g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鱼头洗净，腌制。","img":"images/432139/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"酸青菜切丝。","img":"images/432139/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"炒锅煸炒酸青菜丝后洗净。","img":"images/432139/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"炒锅内放入猪油。","img":"images/432139/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"用猪油炸一下鱼头。","img":"images/432139/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"鱼骨过油。","img":"images/432139/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"用油炒香酸青菜丝。","img":"images/432139/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"汤锅内加入高汤，放黑木耳和鱼骨熬汤。","img":"images/432139/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"烧开后，加炒香的酸青菜丝熬制。","img":"images/432139/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"酸香味出来后，放鱼头和胡萝卜片熬汤。","img":"images/432139/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入鸡精，半小时后，一锅酸香味扑鼻的鱼头锅完成。","img":"images/432139/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"可加入粉丝、豆皮……烫食，即成酸香小火锅。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：汤锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}